+#### [ailaw1](https://github.com/satashili/ailaw1)
+> **Description:** `ailaw1` is a contract analysis web application that reviews agreements from Party A, Party B, or neutral perspectives. Its README highlights risk identification, clause-level analysis, modification suggestions, file upload, authentication, and support for TXT, DOC, DOCX, and PDF inputs. It is not a giant framework, but it is a practical example of how smaller firms might build perspective-based contract triage. GitHub metadata at research time: 18 stars, primary language JavaScript, MIT license, and last update on Mar 2, 2025.
