+#### [LexAI](https://github.com/ulanch/lexai)
+> **Description:** LexAI is a proof-of-concept legal research assistant built with GPT-4 and Gradio. The repository explains a simple but relevant stack for lawyers: location-aware legal answers, jurisdiction-specific embeddings, semantic search, and a lightweight interface that can be adapted to local statutes or internal legal memos. It is intentionally narrow, which makes it easier to understand and extend than heavier platforms. GitHub metadata at research time: 26 stars, primary language Python, MIT license, and last update on Jul 17, 2025.
